  <!-- ── SUGGESTED MULTI-SERIES SEQUENCES ── -->
  <p class="card-label mb-sm">Suggested Series Sequences for Complex Charts</p>
  <div class="callout mb-md">
    When using multiple series, lead with the brand primaries and extend outward using colours from different visual families. Avoid placing similar hues (e.g. Amber + Brand Yellow) in adjacent series without a shape or pattern supplement.
  </div>

  <div class="col-md">

    <div class="card-sm">
      <div class="kicker kicker--muted">UP TO 6 SERIES — Core palette only</div>
      <div class="row-wrap-xs">
        <div class="row-xs"><div class="dot dot--yellow"></div><span class="mono-sm">#FFCD00</span></div>
        <div class="row-xs"><div class="dot dot--orange"></div><span class="mono-sm">#FF4F00</span></div>
